.Dd August 23, 2026
.Dt PQFREEBSD 4
.Os
.Sh NAME
.Nm pqfreebsd
.Nd PQFreeBSD suite and skeletal core KLD
.Sh DESCRIPTION
.Nm
names both the PQFreeBSD userland suite
.Pq pqf skills
and the always-required skeletal core kernel module shipped by
.Em pqk
.Pq
.Lk https://github.com/brianreborn/pqfreebsd_kernel .
The kernel module holds
.Va security.pqfreebsd.enforcement
and
.Va security.pqfreebsd.audit ;
see the
.Nm pqfreebsd
manual in the pqk tree for load and sysctl details.
.Pp
The suite composes
.Xr mac_lomac 4
and optional orthogonal
.Xr mac 4
modules with userland packages
.Nm pqledger
and
.Nm pqdac .
GENERIC already ships
.Ql options MAC .
.Pp
Do not load
.Xr mac_biba 4
or
.Xr mac_mls 4
alongside LOMAC unless a second flow proof is explicitly wanted.
.Pp
ZFS hosts may also load
.Nm pqfreebsd_compat_zfs_multilabel
from pqk; UFS/FFS does not need it.
.Sh SEE ALSO
.Xr mac 4 ,
.Xr mac_lomac 4 ,
.Xr mac_seeotheruids 4 ,
.Xr mac_bsdextended 4 ,
.Xr loader.conf 5 ,
.Xr pqfreebsd 7 ,
.Xr pqfreebsd 8
